      "content": "AI & Machine Learning | Google Cloud Blog AI & Machine Learning Find news, updates, and best practices for AI and machine learning solutions on Google Cloud. AI & Machine Learning Everything Google Cloud customers need to know coming out of Google I/O Today at Google I/O, we’re doubling down on our mission to support the Agentic Enterprise by delivering new AI innovations and putting them directly in the hands of enterprises via Gemini Enterprise, Agent Platform, and Google Workspace. By Thomas Kurian • 11-minute read Read article AI & Machine Learning The new Gemini Enterprise: one platform for agent development, orchestration, and governance By Brian Delahunty • 7-minute read AI & Machine Learning What Google Cloud announced in AI this month By Andrea Sanin • 20-minute read News in short A quick take on updates, announcements, resources, events, and learning opportunities from Google Cloud in one handy location. Updated weekly. Read now Data Analytics Introducing the Open Knowledge Format By Sam McVeety • 8-minute read Security & Identity Powering the next era of Confidential AI By Amit Patil • 3-minute read AI & Machine Learning Claude Fable 5: Available on Google Cloud By Michael Gerstenhaber • 1-minute read AI & Machine Learning How to unlock true ROI in software development – a deep dive into the latest DORA research By Dr. Ursula Löbbert-Passing • 4-minute read Security & Identity Detecting and containing AI-powered threats with Google Security Operations agents By Jon Ramsey • 5-minute read Containers & Kubernetes Report: GKE Inference Gateway delivers up to 92% faster AI responses By Bob Tian • 5-minute read Databases Modernizing Healthcare: How Alcidion achieved greater stability and performance with AlloyDB By Raj Pai • 4-minute read Data Analytics What's new for Managed Service for Apache Spark clusters By Qiqi Wu • 6-minute read Data Analytics The fully-managed Remote MCP Server for AlloyDB is now Generally Available By Paul Ramsey • 5